        <type>size_t</type>
        <definition>size_t themis::WomTree::Config::buffer_size_bytes</definition>
        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>buffer_size_bytes</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::WomTree::Config::buffer_size_bytes</qualifiedname>
        <initializer>= 64 * 1024</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Target size in bytes for the write buffer held at each internal node. Larger values → fewer propagation steps → lower write amplification, but higher per-node memory usage. Recommended: 64 KiB–512 KiB. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
