        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>fanout</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::WomTree::Config::fanout</qualifiedname>
        <initializer>= 16</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Fanout factor B: maximum number of children per internal node. Must be ≥ 2. Higher fanout reduces tree height (fewer read amplification levels) at the cost of larger nodes. </para>
